extual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003:m0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"范雲","kind":"person","person_id":"nln_ldz_i3j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003:m0141","start":141,"end":144,"surface":"裴長穆","kind":"person","person_id":"lpq_6f7_ib4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji:p003:m0156","start":156,"end":157,"surface":"稷","kind":"person","person_id":"ant_dk4_dds","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-016-zhangji","book_id":"b-liangshu-016","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-016-zhangji-ws1508503"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002","text":"子野生而偏孤，爲祖母所養，年九歲，祖母亡，泣血哀慟，家人異之。少好學，善屬文。起家齊武陵王國左常侍，右軍江夏王參軍，遭父憂去職。居喪盡禮，每之墓所，哭泣處草爲之枯，有白兔馴擾其側。天監初，尚書僕射范雲嘉其行，將表奏之，會雲卒，不果。樂安任昉有盛名，爲後進所慕，遊其門者，昉必相薦達。子野於昉爲從中表，獨不至，昉亦恨焉。久之，除右軍安成王參軍，俄遷兼廷尉正。時三官通署獄牒，子野嘗不在，同僚輒署其名，奏有不允，子野從坐免職。或勸言諸有司，可得無咎。子野笑而答曰：「雖慚柳季之道，豈因訟以受服。」自此免黜久之，終無恨意。","source_position":{"start":275,"end":535,"raw":"　　子野生而偏孤，爲祖母所養，年九歲，祖母亡，泣血哀慟，家人異之。少好學，善屬文。起家齊武陵王國左常侍，右軍江夏王參軍，遭父憂去職。居喪盡禮，每之墓所，哭泣處草爲之枯，有白兔馴擾其側。天監初，尚書僕射范雲嘉其行，將表奏之，會雲卒，不果。樂安任昉有盛名，爲後進所慕，遊其門者，昉必相薦達。子野於昉爲從中表，獨不至，昉亦恨焉。久之，除右軍安成王參軍，俄遷兼廷尉正。時三官通署獄牒，子野嘗不在，同僚輒署其名，奏有不允，子野從坐免職。或勸言諸有司，可得無咎。子野笑而答曰：「雖慚柳季之道，豈因訟以受服。」自此免黜久之，終無恨意。","raw_path":"sources/liangshu/wikisource-1508510-raw.wikitext"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"祖母","kind":"person","person_id":"f3f_bze_579","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁明祖母養且年九祖母亡；南史同事件明殷氏。保祖母／哺養，不在本包推她與祖駰婚姻或生父母。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"祖母","kind":"person","person_id":"f3f_bze_579","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁明祖母養且年九祖母亡；南史同事件明殷氏。保祖母／哺養，不在本包推她與祖駰婚姻或生父母。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0041","start":41,"end":45,"surface":"齊武陵王","kind":"person","person_id":"i1v_ajd_qr0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"齊武陵王爵號與南齊035武陵昭王曄完整傳及時代相符，暫定同人，非晉武陵王晞；尚未以直接府屬名單交核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"江夏王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"齊世江夏有南齊035鋒、050寶玄兩王完整傳，所讀均未明本句右軍府與子野，不任選；排除宋義恭，保兩正史候選、不創第三人。","candidate_person_ids":[]},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁父昭明，南史駰子昭明／昭明子子野。不得套史記殷祖昭明。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"范雲","kind":"person","person_id":"nln_ldz_i3j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"雲","kind":"person","person_id":"nln_ldz_i3j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"任昉","kind":"person","person_id":"tvc_q3c_t7w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"昉","kind":"person","person_id":"tvc_q3c_t7w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0144","start":144,"end":145,"surface":"昉","kind":"person","person_id":"tvc_q3c_t7w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0154","start":154,"end":155,"surface":"昉","kind":"person","person_id":"tvc_q3c_t7w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0165","start":165,"end":168,"surface":"安成王","kind":"person","person_id":"z8c_kq5_fri","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁022安成康王秀明天監元封安成、三年右將軍，且傳末明裴子野為王門撰文；與梁030右軍安成王脈絡相符。右軍/右將軍字面差與年份不矯原字，不據此授子野實任年。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0196","start":196,"end":197,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0223","start":223,"end":225,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p002:m0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"柳季","kind":"person","person_id":"myy_zdg_6b6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"固定《論語註疏》卷15孔注明柳下惠展禽，疏並及柳下季；卷18士師三黜直道不枉之章對上子野兼廷尉正受代署牽連而免職、拒向有司申訟且終無恨意之完整語境。判同柳季，保原稱；不是依同名或單一候選自動配人。古注二十字五十字不作年齡資料。"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510"},{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005","text":"及魏軍動，竟陵王子良于東府募人，板融甯朔將軍、軍主。融文辭捷速，有所造作，援筆可待，子良特相友好。晚節大習騎馬，招集江西傖楚數百人，並有幹用，融特爲謀主。武帝病篤暫絶，子良在殿內，太孫未入，融戎服絳衫，於中書省合口斷東宮仗不得進，欲矯詔立子良。詔草已立，上重蘇，朝事委西昌侯鸞。梁武謂範雲曰：「左手據天下圖，右手刎其喉，愚夫不爲。主上大漸，國家自有故事，道路籍籍，將有非常之舉，卿聞之乎？」雲不敢答。俄而帝崩，融乃處分以子良兵禁諸門，西昌侯聞，急馳到雲龍門，不得進，乃曰：「有敕召我。」仍排而入，奉太孫登殿，命左右扶出子良，指麾音響如鍾，殿內無不從命。融知不遂，乃釋服還省，歎曰：「公誤我。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":8,"end":10,"surface":"子良","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0008","person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作良。"},{"start":17,"end":18,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0017","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":26,"end":27,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0026","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":42,"end":44,"surface":"子良","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0042","person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作良。"},{"start":71,"end":72,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0071","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":84,"end":86,"surface":"子良","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0084","person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作良。"},{"start":95,"end":96,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0095","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":119,"end":121,"surface":"子良","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0119","person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作良。"},{"start":137,"end":138,"surface":"鸞","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m0137","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作鸞。"},{"start":142,"end":144,"surface":"範雲","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p005:m01